## Description
Policy question: {How can crime data on the type, location, day, 
and time of offenses help policymakers allocate police resources 
more effectively and develop targeted crime-prevention strategies?}

{The analysis aims to transform raw crime records into actionable evidence for public policy. 
Rather than treating crime as a uniform problem across a city, it can help identify which crimes occur, 
where they occur, and when they are most likely to occur, 
supporting more evidence-based decisions about public safety.}

